Thanks to all those who responded. It would appear that the card is likely
a KZPBA-CY which is an HVD device. See below... (thanks Bob)


The Qlogic 1040B/V2 is a KZPBA-CY type controller and that is regular (or
high voltage) differential. the specs for this controller are a bus length
of no more than 25 meters but have also seen some docs that mention to try
not to exceed 20 meters.

thanks again.
