a configuration where we will be using HSG80s to provide mirror pairs to =
the OS.=A0 LSM would not be used for mirroring and there would be no DRL =
configured either.=A0 All LSM would do is "manage" the disk (unit) in =
its own disk group and create one volume from that disk that was the =
same size as the whole disk.=A0=20
=A0
