Thanks to "Luo, Gary" <gary.luo@hp.com> and "O'Brien, Pat"
<pobrien@mitidata.com>, the answer for my original question below is:

License String is obsolete on HSZ70. It works on controllers like
HSx30, HSx40.
Use 'HSZ> RUN FLS' for such purpose, 'HSZ> DIR' for utility list.

