>DIGITAL Personal WorkStation a/au-Series
>
>
>
>Console Mode switching
>
>      WindowsNT to SRM
>      SRM to WindowsNT
>
>To switch from WindowsNT to SRM for OpenVMS or Digital Unix
>
>    1.From Windows NT, choose Shut down with no reboot.
>    2.Restart the computer. Using the reset button or by cycling power.
>    3.Press [F2] to enter AlphaBIOS Setup
>    4.To change console selection, from the Setup menu, choose CMOS Setup.
>    5.Press [Enter]
>    6.Press [F6] to enter Advanced Setup.
>    7.Tab to Console Selection.
>    8.Select "Digital UNIX Conslole (SRM)" or "OpenVMS Console (SRM)"
>
>
>To switch from the DIGITAL UNIX or OpenVMS operating system to Windows NT,
>follow these steps:
>
>    1. Shut down the system to the SRM console.
>    2. At the  SRM prompt (>>>) type  set os_type nt
>    3. Power cycle the machine, waiting 45 seconds before powering up the
>machine.
>    4.The AlphaBios console should be displayed.
>    5.Check the date and time.
>
