Thanks to all who replied. proc subsystem is the
answer. 


RESPONSES::

**
The info you need is in the "System config and Tuning"
Manual

**
You need to look under the proc subsystem under
dxkerneltuner, check 
out the max* parameters.  I think you'll probably be
able to figure it out from there.  This changes the
maximum limit for all users though, not a per process
or user limit btw.  ulimit will only change the sizes
up to the max listed in the proc subsystem.


