.  It needs to read: pmaglinger@domain.com jdoe@domain.com jsmith@domain.com

Further, while we're on the subject of mail, when an email is generated by
the root account to my Exchange account, the address comes across as:
root@servername.domainname.com .  We would prefer for it to come across as
root@domainname.com as this is the way things are set up on our Exchange
server.  Can anyone provide some guidance?  We're running Tru64Unix 5.1a.

