3. Installation of Patch Kit 3
4. Execution of clu_create command

In this situation according to release notes you must perform two additional
steps before running the clu_create command :

First run the versw version switch command to set new version identifier

# /usr/sbin/versw -setnew

and second run versw command again to switch to the new version

